              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "MAMALEIGH"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Pretty good. I rimmed the glass with sugar and decreased the rum to 9 ounces. I felt that 12 ounces would've been way too much for me. I prefer the \"Best Strawberry Daiquiri\" recipe from this site. If I want a frozen lime drink, I'll stick with the \"Margaritas\" on this site. I think that coconut rum, as mentioned by another reviewer, is an excellent idea!",
